<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-JAPAN WIN KIRIN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JAPAN WIN KIRIN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan beat Turkey 1-0 (halftime 1-0) to win the three-nation Kirin Cup soccer tournament on Sunday.</p>
</text>
